  - the `project` columns `name`, `address` (not blank), `type` (one of `kitchen`, `bath`, `whole_home_interior`), `scope_of_work` and `settings jsonb` (`supabase/migrations/20261019165203_create_project.sql:9-20`);
  - `public.create_project` with its customer check (`customer_unavailable`) and type check (`20261105105039_create_create_project.sql:7, 25`);
  - `edit_lock.lock_epoch` (`20261105200000_create_edit_lock.sql:8`);
  - the permission keys `create_projects`, `edit_model`, `send_to_client`, `settings_company` (`app/src/lib/permissions/catalog.ts:17, 18, 35, 43`);
